.agency.agency-project-detail
  include @blocks/agency/cta/cta.pug
  include ../../_agency-navigation.pug
  section.agency-section--tight
    .agency-shell
      nav.agency-breadcrumbs(aria-label="Breadcrumb")
        a(href=route("agency.home")) Home
        span(aria-hidden="true") /
        a(href=route("agency.projects")) Work
        span(aria-hidden="true") /
        span(aria-current="page") Northline House
      .agency-case-hero
        div
          p.agency-eyebrow Place · Strategy · Identity
          h1 A neighborhood with room to belong.
          p.agency-lead Northline House is a new collection of homes built around a simple belief: a place feels like home when people feel part of it.
          .agency-actions
            a.agency-button(href=route("agency.contact")) Make something together #[span.agency-arrow(aria-hidden="true") →]
        figure.agency-case-hero__image
          img(src=require("@pages/agency/assets/northline.svg"), alt="Northline House branding with forest green, warm cream and architectural geometry", width="1200", height="900")
      dl.agency-case-facts
        div: dt Client #[dd Northline House]
        div: dt Services #[dd Strategy, identity]
        div: dt Year #[dd 2025]
  section.agency-section.agency-band(aria-labelledby="northline-challenge")
    .agency-shell.agency-split
      div
        p.agency-eyebrow The challenge
        h2#northline-challenge Make a new place feel familiar.
      div
        p Northline had an ambitious plan and a thoughtful team, but no shared story to help people understand what made this neighborhood different. We needed to express the warmth of a real community before its first residents arrived.
        p We brought residents, local makers and the development team into the same conversation, then looked for common ground in the everyday things that make a place feel lived in.
  section.agency-section(aria-labelledby="northline-response")
    .agency-shell.agency-split.agency-split--reverse
      div
        p.agency-eyebrow What we made
        h2#northline-response A visual identity rooted in the landscape.
        p The final system pairs an open, human wordmark with shapes inspired by the buildings, paths and tree canopy on site. Its palette feels grounded, and its flexible graphic language gives each part of the neighborhood room to be itself.
        ul.agency-check-list
          li Positioning and story platform
          li Naming and verbal identity
          li Visual identity and art direction
          li Brand toolkit for future communications
      figure.agency-art
        img(src=require("@pages/agency/assets/northline.svg"), alt="Northline House identity system on cream paper with geometric forms", width="1200", height="900", loading="lazy")
  section.agency-section--tight
    +agencyCta({ eyebrow: "Thoughtful work starts somewhere", title: "Have a place or idea you want to bring to life?", action: "Start a conversation", href: route("agency.contact") })
  include ../../_agency-footer.pug
